        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know, it's a very bad idea to open random e-mail attachments from very suspicious e-mails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it happened, and now we're here, deep inside a system, altering the sets of instructions sent to the CPU every second for our own amusement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975940/extras/21971f16eb2d9282c2a67fa170441b56.avif?t=1766081131\" width=854 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple, download files by eating them, destroy as many enemies as you can, reach a new high score, over and over again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three types of enemies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Phil}</strong> - Yellow - He doesn't do much, he has a normal speed and that's about it. His brothers are bullying him for not having any special skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Ivan}</strong> - Red - This one is very chaotic and fast, he can easily ruin your day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Alexander}</strong> - Purple - He's slow, but calculated, it's best if you avoid him!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, you have plenty of tools at your disposal, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>{WORMS}</strong></i> - These lovely fellas will download files for you, even other power-ups, they're weak against the enemies, but they will try their best!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>{ROOTKITS}</strong></i> - These friend-shaped spiders will munch away all the enemies in their path, and download all the files they come across except power-ups, but they want to keep their cut!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>{FORKBOMBS}</strong></i> - Moving back and forth in a single direction, or acting as a barrier, these will decimate your enemies and let you roam freely. However, they cannot collect data files.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the purple food which allows you to munch away your enemies for a short amount of time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once per round, a mysterious item will spawn, it will grant you a second life. Quite a life saver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are absolutely <i><strong>NO</strong></i> cooldowns on your power-ups, but there's a catch! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot hoard them for later, which may inevitably lead you to spamming the power-ups and that's absolutely fine! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware the more power-ups you use, the bigger the chance for a denial of service to trigger, which will destroy everything in its path (except for you!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to take a nostalgic trip to the memory lane, and just sit back and enjoy some good 'ol fashioned arcade chaos, where the only thing that matters is to have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prologue and the game interface are only available in English, and will never be translated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Menu is currently available in: English, l33tsp3ak Russian, Romanian and Chinese with more to come.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help page is currently available only in English, with Russian and Romanian to be added next week.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I will add more languages when i find translators!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know, it's a very bad idea to open random e-mail attachments from very suspicious e-mails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it happened, and now we're here, deep inside a system, altering the sets of instructions sent to the CPU every second for our own amusement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975940/extras/21971f16eb2d9282c2a67fa170441b56.avif?t=1766081131\" width=854 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple, download files by eating them, destroy as many enemies as you can, reach a new high score, over and over again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three types of enemies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Phil}</strong> - Yellow - He doesn't do much, he has a normal speed and that's about it. His brothers are bullying him for not having any special skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Ivan}</strong> - Red - This one is very chaotic and fast, he can easily ruin your day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Alexander}</strong> - Purple - He's slow, but calculated, it's best if you avoid him!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, you have plenty of tools at your disposal, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>{WORMS}</strong></i> - These lovely fellas will download files for you, even other power-ups, they're weak against the enemies, but they will try their best!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>{ROOTKITS}</strong></i> - These friend-shaped spiders will munch away all the enemies in their path, and download all the files they come across except power-ups, but they want to keep their cut!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>{FORKBOMBS}</strong></i> - Moving back and forth in a single direction, or acting as a barrier, these will decimate your enemies and let you roam freely. However, they cannot collect data files.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the purple food which allows you to munch away your enemies for a short amount of time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once per round, a mysterious item will spawn, it will grant you a second life. Quite a life saver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are absolutely <i><strong>NO</strong></i> cooldowns on your power-ups, but there's a catch! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot hoard them for later, which may inevitably lead you to spamming the power-ups and that's absolutely fine! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware the more power-ups you use, the bigger the chance for a denial of service to trigger, which will destroy everything in its path (except for you!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to take a nostalgic trip to the memory lane, and just sit back and enjoy some good 'ol fashioned arcade chaos, where the only thing that matters is to have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prologue and the game interface are only available in English, and will never be translated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Menu is currently available in: English, l33tsp3ak Russian, Romanian and Chinese with more to come.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help page is currently available only in English, with Russian and Romanian to be added next week.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I will add more languages when i find translators!</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "A fast paced arcade maze chasing game inspired by the 90s media portrayal of hackers and their culture. Download files, evade enemies, collect power-ups, launch rootkits, worms, and forkbombs and unleash total chaos.",
